#ASSERT `Art 2(4) the constitution of the entity in all its kinds consists of` `the interpretation of Articles 1 and 2 with F1.4 read the other way` (LIST `the trustees of a trust`, `a company`) EQUALS LIST "the terms of the trust"
-- A single kind gives the same on both readings.
#ASSERT `Art 2(4) the constitution of the entity in all its kinds consists of` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 1 and 2` (LIST `a foundation`) EQUALS LIST "the charter and regulations of the foundation"
#ASSERT `Art 2(4) the constitution of the entity in all its kinds consists of` `the interpretation of Articles 1 and 2 with F1.4 read the other way` (LIST `a foundation`) EQUALS LIST "the charter and regulations of the foundation"
-- "In any other case" applies only when none of (a) to (f) does.
#ASSERT `Art 2(4) the constitution of the entity in all its kinds consists of` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 1 and 2` (LIST `an unincorporated body or association of persons`) EQUALS LIST "any instrument or instruments (in whatever form) that establish the entity or give it any powers"
#ASSERT `Art 2(4) the constitution of the entity in all its kinds consists of` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 1 and 2` (LIST `a company`, `an unincorporated body or association of persons`) EQUALS LIST "the memorandum and articles of association of the company"
-- Not an entity: no constitution.
#ASSERT `Art 2(4) the constitution of the entity in all its kinds consists of` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 1 and 2` EMPTY EQUALS EMPTY
-- An Order's sub-paragraph is "any other case".
#ASSERT `Art 2(4) the constitution of the entity in all its kinds consists of` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 1 and 2` (LIST (`an entity added by an Order under Article 2(2)` "(k)")) EQUALS LIST "any instrument or instruments (in whatever form) that establish the entity or give it any powers"
-- The order of the cases is the paragraph's, not the order of the kinds: a company listed before the trustees still gives the trust's case first on reading B.
