#ASSERT `Art 2(4) the constitution of the entity in all its kinds consists of` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 1 and 2` (LIST `a company`, `the trustees of a trust`) EQUALS LIST "the terms of the trust", "the memorandum and articles of association of the company"

