#ASSERT `Art 2(5) the constitutional Laws of the entity are` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 1 and 2` (LIST `a foundation`) `a foundation body` EQUALS LIST `the Foundations (Jersey) Law 2009`
#ASSERT `Art 2(5) the constitutional Laws of the entity are` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 1 and 2` (LIST `a company`) `a company body` EQUALS LIST `the Companies (Jersey) Law 1991`
