#ASSERT `Art 2(5) the constitutional Laws of the entity are` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 1 and 2` (LIST (`an entity added by an Order under Article 2(2)` "(k)")) `a body within an added sub-paragraph` EQUALS EMPTY
-- F1.3: a body incorporated "under, but not by" an enactment (g) or an Act (h). Reading A (taken): none. Reading B: the enactment under which it was incorporated.
