#ASSERT `Art 2(5) the constitutional Laws of the entity are` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 1 and 2` (LIST `a body incorporated under, but not by, an Act of the United Kingdom Parliament or Order in Council`) `a body incorporated under a UK Act with its Act named` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `Art 2(5) the constitutional Laws of the entity are` `the interpretation of Articles 1 and 2 with F1.3 read the other way` (LIST `a body incorporated under, but not by, an enactment other than the Companies (Jersey) Law 1991`) `a body incorporated under an enactment with its enactment named` EQUALS LIST `the enactment under which the body was incorporated` "Example Associations (Jersey) Law 1990"
#ASSERT `Art 2(5) the constitutional Laws of the entity are` `the interpretation of Articles 1 and 2 with F1.3 read the other way` (LIST `a body incorporated under, but not by, an Act of the United Kingdom Parliament or Order in Council`) `a body incorporated under a UK Act with its Act named` EQUALS LIST `the enactment under which the body was incorporated` "Example Act 1900"
-- ... and reading B still gives none where the enactment is not named.
