#ASSERT `Art 2(5) the constitutional Laws of the entity are` `the interpretation of Articles 1 and 2 with F1.4 read the other way` (LIST `the trustees of a trust`, `a company`) `a company that is the sole trustee` EQUALS LIST `the Trusts (Jersey) Law 1984`
