#ASSERT `Art 2(5) the constitutional Law of the entity is` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 1 and 2` `a body incorporated under, but not by, an enactment other than the Companies (Jersey) Law 1991` `a body incorporated under an enactment with its enactment named` EQUALS NOTHING
